                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    participant User\n    participant Frontend as Frontend Dashboard\n    participant Backend as Backend Server\n    participant DB as MySQL Database\n    participant ESP as ESP8266 Gateway\n    participant STM as STM32 Controller\n    participant Sensor as Sensors\n    participant Relay as Relay Module\n\n    %% Sensor Monitoring\n    Sensor-&gt;&gt;STM: Read Temperature / Humidity / Light\n    STM-&gt;&gt;ESP: Send Sensor Data (UART)\n    ESP-&gt;&gt;Backend: Upload Data (HTTP/MQTT)\n    Backend-&gt;&gt;DB: Store Sensor Data\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Backend: Store Success\n    Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: REST API Response\n    Frontend--&gt;&gt;User: Display Real-time Dashboard\n\n    %% User Control\n    User-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Control Device\n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;Backend: POST /api/control\n    Backend-&gt;&gt;ESP: Control Command\n    ESP-&gt;&gt;STM: UART Command\n    STM-&gt;&gt;Relay: GPIO Signal\n    Relay-&gt;&gt;Relay: Switch ON/OFF Device\n\n    %% Status Feedback\n    STM-&gt;&gt;ESP: Device Status\n    ESP-&gt;&gt;Backend: Upload Status\n    Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Update Device Status\n    Frontend--&gt;&gt;User: Show Updated Status&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
